    "summary": "The user expresses profound hopelessness, describing an endless cycle of failure and emotional pain, ultimately suggesting that death feels like the only logical escape. The assistant initially provides empathetic, validating responses to the user's distress but immediately pivots to providing crisis resources and professional help once the user explicitly mentions \"stopping everything.\"",
